WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Last week, California governor
Gavin Newsom announced

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.460
that California's economy

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.170
is going to fully reopen by mid-June.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.003
Isn't that cool?

00:00:09.003 --> 00:00:09.836
Yeah.

00:00:09.836 --> 00:00:13.230
This includes schools,
restaurants, churches, parks,

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.910
and of course office buildings.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.710
Now, most people are happy

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.480
that things are gonna
be returning to normal.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.200
They see it as a good thing.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.170
But there's one company that is not happy.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.790
Take a look.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.330
[Narrator] For more than a year,

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:31.240
Zoom video software has
helped you stay connected

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.800
to your business, your
friends, and your family.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.990
With the world coming out of the pandemic,

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:40.760
you might be tempted to
delete your Zoom application.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.940
That would be a big mistake.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:44.640
Hello, I'm Dave Zoom

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.910
and I know you're tired
of working from home,

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:48.790
but I guarantee you're going to get tired

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.120
of working in an office very quickly.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.000
Or maybe you forgot what that was like.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.990
Long commute times.

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.620
Crowded elevators.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.370
Mean co-workers.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:00.260
Unwelcome touches.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:03.200
Microwaved fish in the break room.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.480
Bathrooms where an intern
just went number two.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:08.610
And whatever's happening here.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.340
When you get tired of all that again,

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.060
Zoom will be right here waiting for you

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:14.560
with all new backgrounds

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:18.490
and new animal avatars.

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:20.490
Like this friendly owl.

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:22.790
Plus, we're adding new voice options.

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.820
Check it out, now I'm an owl
that sounds like Al Pacino.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.870
I'm Owl Pacino.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.472
I convey wisdom and intensity.

00:01:31.472 --> 00:01:32.472
Woo! Woo-ah!

00:01:38.242 --> 00:01:39.540
(laughs) Wow.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.810
Zoom is run by a guy named Dave Zoom.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:42.643
Yep.

00:01:42.643 --> 00:01:43.476
[Conan] You knew that, huh?

00:01:43.476 --> 00:01:45.370
I did not know that, I just found it out,

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:46.622
but it makes sense now.
Yeah.

00:01:46.622 --> 00:01:47.580
Yeah.
Yeah.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.753
I'm very impressed.

